      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leba, ekiro ky'Omukama eky'eiramu kili haihi, orwo balibagabira ebyo mwanyagirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndihuruza amahanga gona gatere Yerusalemu. Ekigo kilikwatwa, amaju ganyagwe, n'abakazi bahambwe. Enusu y'ekigo balitwarwa omu buzahe, kyonkai abasigaire baliikaramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Omukama alitabara arashane n'amahanga ago, nk'okwo arashana aha kiro ky'endashana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro kyonene ekyo alyemelera aha Ibanga ly'Emizeituni elilebangaine na Yerusalemu rubaju orw'oburuga izoba. Eibanga ly'Emizeituni elyo lilibeganukamu kabili kwema oburugaizoba kugya obugwaizoba, lilitaishuranwa oruhanga ruhango muno. Enusu y'eibanga elyo elisikukira amagyaruguru, kandi enusu esikukire amagyaifo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oruhanga orwo omugati y'amabanga gange nimwo mulisingirwa mukarwijura, nangu n'omwanya gukaburamu, kulemwa kugoba Yasoli, nk'okwo babaire barwijwire aha rw'omusisi omu makiro g'Omukama Uzia owa Yuda. Nirwo Omukama Ruhanga wanyu alija n'abamalaika bona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo talibaho mbeho anga ruho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gulikara guli mushana (ekiro ekyo Omukama wenkai niwe alikukimanya). Teliba nyemishana, kandi tikiliba kiro, kuba n'omu bwaigoro guliba mushana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo amaizi g'oburora galigera nigaruga Yerusalemu. Enusu yago egye omu nyanja y'oburugaizoba, n'obundi bugye omu nyanja ey'obugwaizoba. Biliba bityo omu kyanda n'omu musenene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama niwe aliba mukama w'ensi yona. Kwema kir'ekyo aliba Mukama omoi n'eibara balimweta elyo limoi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi yona kwema Geba kugoba Rimoni obugyaifo bwa Yerusalemu elihinduka ruhita. Kyonkai Yerusalemu elikara eiguru mbali eli kubandiza aha Kihigi kya Benjamini kuturuka aha Kihigi ky'Enshonda mbali habaire hali ekihigi ekya karai, n'okwema aha Munara gwa Hananeli kugoba aha majungiro g'edivai g'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu balitur'omwo, kuba omuraamo guliba guhoire. Yerusalemu nayo elitura omu milembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amahanga gona agatura garashanisa Yerusalemu, Omukama alibateza ekibundo eki: Balijunda emibili bakyayemeleire, amaisho gabajundire omu binonko, n'endimi zibajundire omu kanwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo Omukama alibakangaranisa, buli omoi akwate mutahiwe omukono, kyonkai bazingirangane entomi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nangu n'aba Yuda balirwanisa aba Yerusalemu, kandi eitunga ly'amahanga gona agataine Yerusalemu: Ezahabu, efeza n'ebijwaro, lilishorozibwa hamoi litali like. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekibundo nk'eki kilitera efarasi, enyumbu, engamia, endogobe, n'ebitunganwa byona byona ebilishangwa bili omu nsi ezo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma buli muntu alihunga aha mahanga gona agaliba gatabalire Yerusalemu, buli mwaka aragyaga Yerusalemu kufukamira Omukama Ruhanga w'amahe n'okushemeza ekiro kikuru ky'ensisira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi eihanga lyona lyona kaliliba litagiire Yerusalemu kufukamira Omukama Rugaba w'amahe, tibaligwisa njura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamisiri baije baburwe kugyayo, abo baliterwa ekibundo eky'Omukama ateza amahanga agatagya Yerusalemu kushemeza kiro kikuru kya nsisira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki kiliba kibonabonyio kya Misiri n'amahanga gona agaliburwa kugya Yerusalemu kushemeza ekiro kikuru ekyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo ekengere z'efarasi zilihandikwaho ziti, “Ehongeirwe Omukama.” N'enyungu za Rwensinga y'Omukama ziliba nk'epakuli omu maisho ga alutare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi buli nyungu omuli Yerusalemu na Yuda baligihongera Omukama w'amahe. Abaraijaga kutamba ebitambo bazikwatega bazichumbiremu enyama y'ekitambo kyabo. Mara kwema kir'ekyo omuli Rwensinga y'Omukama w'amahe baliba batakitundiramu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
